#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:88
msgid ""
"|morpheus| automatically seeds MySQL, Redis and RabbitMQ PCF Instance "
"Types, as well as a generic Cloud Foundry Instance Type that will create "
"a shell app used in conjunction with deployments. PCF Marketplace items "
"can also be added to the Provisioning Library in the Cloud detail view "
"Marketplace tab. The Marketplace item will be added to the selected "
"Instance Type and available when selecting the Cloud Foundry Cloud during"
" Instance or App Template creation."
msgstr "O |morpheus| automaticamente popula Tipos de Instância PCF MySQL, Redis e RabbitMQ, bem como um Tipo de Instância Cloud Foundry genérico que criará um app shell usado em conjunto com deployments. Itens do Marketplace PCF também podem ser adicionados à Biblioteca de Provisionamento na aba Marketplace da visualização de detalhes da Nuvem. O item do Marketplace será adicionado ao Tipo de Instância selecionado e ficará disponível ao selecionar a Nuvem Cloud Foundry durante a criação de Instância ou App Template."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:91
msgid "Deployments"
msgstr "Deployments"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:93
msgid ""
"The Cloud Foundry App Instance Type is used in conjunction with "
"deployments. Users do not have to pick deployment when creating a Cloud "
"Foundry App Instance Type, but then Instance will only be a shell of a "
"Cloud Foundry Application."
msgstr "O Tipo de Instância Cloud Foundry App é usado em conjunto com deployments. Os usuários não precisam escolher um deployment ao criar um Tipo de Instância Cloud Foundry App, mas então a Instância será apenas um shell de uma Aplicação Cloud Foundry."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:95
msgid ""
"A deployment in Morpheus can either point to a git hub repository or "
"contain the actual manifest.yml and associated artifacts required for a "
"Cloud Foundry deployment.  During the deployment, Morpheus will gather up"
" the files required.  Therefore, if the deployment points to a git hub "
"repository, Morpheus will fetch the files from git hub.  Once the files "
"are obtained, Morpheus will deploy the artifacts in a similar fashion to "
"the Cloud Foundry cli.  This includes parsing the manifest to obtain the "
"parameters to create or update the Cloud Foundry application.  Morpheus "
"will ignore certain fields such as memory and disk size because they are "
"dictated by the selected plan.  Other fields are utilized such as routes."
"  After parsing the manifest.yml file (including overwriting certain "
"fields), Morpheus is ready to update or create the App in Cloud Foundry."
msgstr "Um deployment no Morpheus pode apontar para um repositório git hub ou conter o manifest.yml real e os artefatos associados necessários para um deployment Cloud Foundry.  Durante o deployment, o Morpheus reunirá os arquivos necessários.  Portanto, se o deployment apontar para um repositório git hub, o Morpheus buscará os arquivos do git hub.  Uma vez obtidos os arquivos, o Morpheus implantará os artefatos de forma semelhante ao cli do Cloud Foundry.  Isso inclui analisar o manifesto para obter os parâmetros para criar ou atualizar a aplicação Cloud Foundry.  O Morpheus ignorará determinados campos como memória e tamanho de disco porque eles são ditados pelo plano selecionado.  Outros campos são utilizados, como rotas.  Após analisar o arquivo manifest.yml (incluindo a sobrescrita de determinados campos), o Morpheus está pronto para atualizar ou criar o App no Cloud Foundry."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:97
msgid ""
"After the App is configured, the artifacts references in the Morpheus "
"deployment are uploaded to Cloud Foundry for the App.  Note that when "
"paths are referenced in the manifest.yml file, the paths continue to be "
"relative to the manifest.  So, a jar file under build/libs would need to "
"be found under the build/libs directory."
msgstr "Após o App ser configurado, os artefatos referenciados no deployment do Morpheus são enviados ao Cloud Foundry para o App.  Observe que quando caminhos são referenciados no arquivo manifest.yml, os caminhos continuam relativos ao manifesto.  Assim, um arquivo jar em build/libs precisaria ser encontrado no diretório build/libs."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:99
msgid ""
"If Cloud Foundry services are specified in the manifest, they must "
"already exist within Cloud Foundry.  Morpheus App templates can be "
"utilized to wire up Cloud Foundry services created by Morpheus.  In this "
"case, Morpheus will add all of the included service names defined in the "
"App template to the manifest.yml services section.  Therefore, multiple "
"services can be used and wired up by Morpheus.”"
msgstr "Se serviços Cloud Foundry forem especificados no manifesto, eles já devem existir no Cloud Foundry.  App templates do Morpheus podem ser utilizados para conectar serviços Cloud Foundry criados pelo Morpheus.  Nesse caso, o Morpheus adicionará todos os nomes de serviço incluídos definidos no App template à seção services do manifest.yml.  Portanto, vários serviços podem ser usados e conectados pelo Morpheus.”"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:102
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Exemplo"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:104
msgid ""
"To better understand how Morpheus parses the manifest.yml file, lets take"
" a closer look at the Cloud Foundry 'spring-music' project.  The project "
"can be found here (https://github.com/cloudfoundry-samples/spring-music)."
msgstr "Para entender melhor como o Morpheus analisa o arquivo manifest.yml, vamos examinar mais de perto o projeto 'spring-music' do Cloud Foundry.  O projeto pode ser encontrado aqui (https://github.com/cloudfoundry-samples/spring-music)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:106
msgid ""
"The project contains the required manifest.yml file as well as the source"
" code and build.gradle file to define how the project is to be built.  "
"After downloading the project to your local machine, build the project to"
" generate the jar."
msgstr "O projeto contém o arquivo manifest.yml necessário, bem como o código-fonte e o arquivo build.gradle para definir como o projeto deve ser construído.  Após baixar o projeto para sua máquina local, construa o projeto para gerar o jar."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:108
msgid "Now, let's take a look at the manifest.yml file:"
msgstr "Agora, vamos examinar o arquivo manifest.yml:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:110
msgid ""
"---\n"
"applications:\n"
"- name: spring-music\n"
"  memory: 1G\n"
"  random-route: true\n"
"  path: build/libs/spring-music.jar"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:120
msgid ""
"Using the Cloud Foundry docs (https://docs.cloudfoundry.org/devguide"
"/deploy-apps/manifest.html), we can gain a better understanding of how "
"this file is utilized by Cloud Foundry."
msgstr "Usando a documentação do Cloud Foundry (https://docs.cloudfoundry.org/devguide/deploy-apps/manifest.html), podemos entender melhor como este arquivo é utilizado pelo Cloud Foundry."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:122
msgid ""
"The ``-name`` parameter defines the name that will be given to the "
"application in Cloud Foundry.  Morpheus will overwrite this value with "
"the name given to the Instance being created in Morpheus."
msgstr "O parâmetro ``-name`` define o nome que será dado à aplicação no Cloud Foundry.  O Morpheus sobrescreverá este valor com o nome dado à Instância sendo criada no Morpheus."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:124
msgid ""
"The ``-memory`` parameter (as well as the disk_quota parameter if "
"specified) will be overwritten by Morpheus based on the plan specified "
"for the Instance."
msgstr "O parâmetro ``-memory`` (assim como o parâmetro disk_quota, se especificado) será sobrescrito pelo Morpheus com base no plano especificado para a Instância."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:126
msgid ""
"The ``-path`` parameter defines, where relative to the manifest.yml file,"
" your Cloud Foundry application can be found."
msgstr "O parâmetro ``-path`` define onde, relativo ao arquivo manifest.yml, sua aplicação Cloud Foundry pode ser encontrada."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/cloudfoundry/cloudfoundry.rst:128
msgid ""
"The ``-random-route parameter``, as well as all other parameters "
"described in the Cloud Foundry documentation will simply be passed "
"through to Cloud Foundry."
msgstr "O parâmetro ``-random-route parameter``, bem como todos os outros parâmetros descritos na documentação do Cloud Foundry, serão simplesmente repassados ao Cloud Foundry."

